---
const meta = "text-[11px] font-normal leading-[1.6] tracking-[0.18em] text-life-muted uppercase";
const focus = "focus-visible:rounded-[2px] focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 focus-visible:outline-life-gold";
---

<section id="stories" aria-labelledby="st-t" class="relative z-1 overflow-x-clip pt-[120px] pb-20 [--life-gutter:40px] [@media(max-width:1100px)]:[--life-gutter:28px] [@media(max-width:720px)]:py-20 [@media(max-width:720px)]:[--life-gutter:18px]" data-life-stories>
  <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-life px-[var(--life-gutter)]">
    <span class="pointer-events-none absolute -top-[0.5em] -left-[0.05em] z-0 text-[clamp(200px,21vw,320px)] font-thin leading-[0.78] tracking-[-0.06em] text-life-gold/30 select-none [@media(max-width:720px)]:relative [@media(max-width:720px)]:top-auto [@media(max-width:720px)]:left-auto [@media(max-width:720px)]:-mb-[0.32em] [@media(max-width:720px)]:block [@media(max-width:720px)]:text-[42vw]" aria-hidden="true" data-life-numeral>03</span>
    <div class="relative z-2 grid gap-3 pl-[19%] [@media(max-width:1100px)]:pl-0" data-life-stories-heading>
      <p class="m-0 text-xs font-bold leading-[1.6] tracking-[0.12em] text-life-gold">03 — 日々の暮らし</p>
      <h2 id="st-t" class="m-0 text-[clamp(76px,9.4vw,150px)] font-bold leading-[0.9] tracking-[-0.03em] uppercase [@media(max-width:720px)]:text-[15.5vw]">Daily life</h2>
      <p class="m-0 text-[clamp(17px,1.5vw,21px)] font-bold leading-[1.55] tracking-[0.06em]">健やかさが、暮らしに続く。</p>
    </div>

    <article class="mt-16 pl-[19%] [@media(max-width:1100px)]:pl-0" data-life-feature>
      <div class="max-w-[48em]" data-life-feature-text>
        <span class={meta}><b class="font-bold text-life-ink">日々の中で大切にしたいこと</b></span>
        <h3 class="mt-[22px] mb-10 text-[clamp(30px,3.1vw,48px)] font-bold leading-[1.45] tracking-[0.06em]">健やかさを、<br />毎日のそばに。</h3>
        <p class="m-0 text-[15px] leading-[2] tracking-[0.04em] text-life-ink/90">身体の健康、心の健やかさ、人とのつながり。INFLUでは、そのどれもがウェルビーイングの一部だと考えています。身体を動かす時間だけでなく、困ったときに誰かと話せることも大切にしています。</p>
        <p class="m-0 mt-6 text-[15px] leading-[2] tracking-[0.04em] text-life-ink/90">ウェルビーイングを、一度きりのイベントで終わらせず、日々の中で育んでいきたい。仲間と身体を動かす時間や、困ったときに相談できる日常も、そのための取り組みです。</p>
      </div>
    </article>

    <div class="mt-16 flex items-baseline justify-between border-t border-life-line-strong pt-[30px] [@media(max-width:720px)]:mt-12 [@media(max-width:720px)]:flex-col [@media(max-width:720px)]:gap-3" data-life-archive>
      <span class={meta}>日々の出来事を、スタッフブログで</span>
      <a class={`group inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 text-[clamp(30px,3.4vw,52px)] font-bold tracking-[-0.035em] transition-colors ease-[ease] duration-[350ms] hover:text-life-gold ${focus}`} href="https://influhp.com/staff-blog/page/1">記事一覧を見る <span class="inline-block transition-transform duration-[450ms] ease-life group-hover:translate-x-[5px] motion-reduce:transition-none">→</span></a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
